note Deep nesting: stop and skip only touch the innermost loop

to find with target and haystack
    repeat 3 times
        for each item in haystack
            if item is target then
                show "found " + item
                stop
            if item is "skipme" then
                skip
            show "checking " + item
    show "done searching"

find with "b" and ["a", "skipme", "b", "c"]
